[
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/asv/phlm#Phlm.1.1",
    "work_id": "scripture/asv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.1",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Paul, a prisoner of Christ Jesus, and Timothy our brother, to Philemon our beloved and fellow-worker,",
    "chunk_index": 0,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/asv/phlm#Phlm.1.2",
    "work_id": "scripture/asv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.2",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "and to Apphia our sister, and to Archippus our fellow-soldier, and to the church in thy house:",
    "chunk_index": 1,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/asv/phlm#Phlm.1.3",
    "work_id": "scripture/asv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.3",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Grace to you and peace from God our Father and the Lord Jesus Christ.",
    "chunk_index": 2,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/asv/phlm#Phlm.1.4",
    "work_id": "scripture/asv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.4",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "I thank my God always, making mention of thee in my prayers,",
    "chunk_index": 3,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/asv/phlm#Phlm.1.5",
    "work_id": "scripture/asv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.5",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "hearing of thy love, and of the faith which thou hast toward the Lord Jesus, and toward all the saints;",
    "chunk_index": 4,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/asv/phlm#Phlm.1.6",
    "work_id": "scripture/asv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.6",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "that the fellowship of thy faith may become effectual, in the knowledge of every good thing which is in you, unto Christ.",
    "chunk_index": 5,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/asv/phlm#Phlm.1.7",
    "work_id": "scripture/asv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.7",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "For I had much joy and comfort in thy love, because the hearts of the saints have been refreshed through thee, brother.",
    "chunk_index": 6,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/asv/phlm#Phlm.1.8",
    "work_id": "scripture/asv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.8",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Wherefore, though I have all boldness in Christ to enjoin thee that which is befitting,",
    "chunk_index": 7,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/asv/phlm#Phlm.1.9",
    "work_id": "scripture/asv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.9",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "yet for love’s sake I rather beseech, being such a one as Paul the aged, and now a prisoner also of Christ Jesus:",
    "chunk_index": 8,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/asv/phlm#Phlm.1.10",
    "work_id": "scripture/asv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.10",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "I beseech thee for my child, whom I have begotten in my bonds, Onesimus,",
    "chunk_index": 9,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/asv/phlm#Phlm.1.11",
    "work_id": "scripture/asv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.11",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "who once was unprofitable to thee, but now is profitable to thee and to me:",
    "chunk_index": 10,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/asv/phlm#Phlm.1.12",
    "work_id": "scripture/asv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.12",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "whom I have sent back to thee in his own person, that is, my very heart:",
    "chunk_index": 11,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/asv/phlm#Phlm.1.13",
    "work_id": "scripture/asv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.13",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "whom I would fain have kept with me, that in thy behalf he might minister unto me in the bonds of the gospel:",
    "chunk_index": 12,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/asv/phlm#Phlm.1.14",
    "work_id": "scripture/asv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.14",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "but without thy mind I would do nothing; that thy goodness should not be as of necessity, but of free will.",
    "chunk_index": 13,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/asv/phlm#Phlm.1.15",
    "work_id": "scripture/asv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.15",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "For perhaps he was therefore parted from thee for a season, that thou shouldest have him for ever;",
    "chunk_index": 14,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/asv/phlm#Phlm.1.16",
    "work_id": "scripture/asv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.16",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "no longer as a servant, but more than a servant, a brother beloved, specially to me, but how much rather to thee, both in the flesh and in the Lord.",
    "chunk_index": 15,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/asv/phlm#Phlm.1.17",
    "work_id": "scripture/asv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.17",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "If then thou countest me a partner, receive him as myself.",
    "chunk_index": 16,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/asv/phlm#Phlm.1.18",
    "work_id": "scripture/asv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.18",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "But if he hath wronged thee at all, or oweth thee aught, put that to mine account;",
    "chunk_index": 17,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/asv/phlm#Phlm.1.19",
    "work_id": "scripture/asv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.19",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "I Paul write it with mine own hand, I will repay it: that I say not unto thee that thou owest to me even thine own self besides.",
    "chunk_index": 18,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/asv/phlm#Phlm.1.20",
    "work_id": "scripture/asv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.20",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Yea, brother, let me have joy of thee in the Lord: refresh my heart in Christ.",
    "chunk_index": 19,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/asv/phlm#Phlm.1.21",
    "work_id": "scripture/asv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.21",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Having confidence in thine obedience I write unto thee, knowing that thou wilt do even beyond what I say.",
    "chunk_index": 20,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/asv/phlm#Phlm.1.22",
    "work_id": "scripture/asv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.22",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "But withal prepare me also a lodging: for I hope that through your prayers I shall be granted unto you.",
    "chunk_index": 21,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/asv/phlm#Phlm.1.23",
    "work_id": "scripture/asv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.23",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Epaphras, my fellow-prisoner in Christ Jesus, saluteth thee;",
    "chunk_index": 22,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/asv/phlm#Phlm.1.24",
    "work_id": "scripture/asv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.24",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "and so do Mark, Aristarchus, Demas, Luke, my fellow-workers.",
    "chunk_index": 23,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/asv/phlm#Phlm.1.25",
    "work_id": "scripture/asv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.25",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "The grace of our Lord Jesus Christ be with your spirit. Amen.",
    "chunk_index": 24,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
